    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.4
  m_Text: "MOVEMENT         Arrow Keys\nFOCUS (Slow)     Left Shift   -   Reveals
    collision point\nSHOOT            Z\nCHARGED SHOT     X (Hold & Release)\nBOMB            
    C   -   Sweeping ring wave, clears bullets\n\nYou have 3 lives. Touching an enemy
    bullet costs one life.\nYour real hitbox is a tiny central dot \u2014 use Focus
    to see it.\nGraze enemy bullets to feel alive."
